# Dev / ops markdown — local laptop only (same policy as XapSync repo)
# Kept in git: README.md, configuration.md, assets/terminal.md,
# docs/ARCHITECTURE_AND_DELIVERABLES.md, docs/TEAM_ARCHITECTURE.md,
# pages/PARAMETERS_IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md, pages/code.md
/*.md
!README.md
!configuration.md
/assets/**/*.md
!assets/terminal.md
/docs/**/*.md
!docs/ARCHITECTURE_AND_DELIVERABLES.md
!docs/TEAM_ARCHITECTURE.md
/pages/**/*.md
!pages/PARAMETERS_IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md
!pages/code.md
